---
import BaseLayout from "../components/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import PlaceholderBox from "../components/PlaceholderBox.astro";
import Disclaimer from "../components/Disclaimer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms" description="Draft terms for this site. Review by the team and, where needed, the university is still pending.">
  <PageHeader
    title="Terms"
    intro="Draft terms for this site. They need review by the team and, where needed, the university. That review is still pending."
  />
  <div class="container">
    <div class="notice">
      <p><strong>Draft.</strong> These terms describe an early release. They are not legal advice. Review by the team and, where needed, the university is still pending.</p>
    </div>
    <h2>Content under review</h2>
    <p>
      This site is an early release. Some sections are still being completed. Facts marked pending,
      placeholders, and draft descriptions may be wrong or incomplete. Do not rely on pending
      claims, and do not republish them as confirmed.
    </p>
    <Disclaimer />
    <h2>Intended use</h2>
    <p>
      The planned detector is a decision-support tool for beekeepers and inspectors. It is not a
      veterinary service, not a laboratory test, and not a substitute for inspection by a qualified
      apiary inspector or lab. Follow local rules on reporting bee diseases.
    </p>
    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      Reported project results from the final report and poster are published on the Research page,
      each with its exact source. They describe the project as reported and do not describe the
      demo models, which are unmeasured. Results from photos depend heavily on photo quality and
      on what is visible in the frame.
    </p>
    <h2>Reuse</h2>
    <p>
      Do not reuse text, images, models, or code from this site without written permission.
      Ownership and licensing between the university, the industry partner, and the team are not
      yet confirmed, and no licence is granted by this site.
    </p>
    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>
      This site may change or go offline without notice. No uptime, support, or service promise
      is made.
    </p>
    <h2>Governing details</h2>
    <PlaceholderBox text="operator identity, governing law, and contact for legal notices, as confirmed by the team and university" />
    <PlaceholderBox text="last-updated date and version of these terms" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
